<%- include('partials/headers/header.ejs', {title: "ResumeScanAI - Instant AI Feedback on Your IT Resume", 
url: "/", robots: "index, follow"}) %>
<main>
  <section class="hero blue__place margin__bottom">
    <div class="hero__container">
      <h1 class="title--text">Resume validity checker AI for IT specialists</h1>
      <h2 class="normal--text">
        ResumeScanAI is a handy tool for programmers, accessible from anywhere
        in the world, allowing them to check resumes using artificial
        intelligence. It is the future for employers, human resources and all
        other IT professions
      </h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how" class="howitworks margin__bottom">
    <div class="howitworks__container">
      <h2 class="subtitle--text">How it works</h2>
      <div class="howitworks__content">
        <ul class="howitworks__list normal--text">
          <li>
            <div>
              <img class="small--img" src="/img/info.svg" alt="step1" />
              <p>
                Welcome to <b>ResumeScanAi</b>, where you can validate your
                resume for different companies and receive both overall and
                targeted feedback to improve it.
              </p>
            </div>
            <img class="howitworks__img" src="/img/how_CV.svg" alt="Upload your CV" />
          </li>
          <li>
            <div>
              <img class="small--img" src="/img/ai.svg" alt="step2" />
              <p>
                Upload your <b>CV</b> in <b>PDF</b> format, select the type of
                company you are targeting and your qualifications. This will
                help artificial intelligence make a more accurate assessment.
              </p>
            </div>
            <img class="howitworks__img" src="/img/how_pdf.svg" alt="Upload your CV" />
          </li>
          <li>
            <div>
              <img class="small--img" src="/img/feedback.svg" alt="step3" />
              <p>
                At the end of the review, you will receive an evaluation with
                <b>positive</b> aspects and <b>suggestions</b> for improvement,
                general recommendations for refining your CV.
              </p>
            </div>
            <img class="howitworks__img" src="/img/how_sw.png" alt="Upload your CV" />
          </li>
          <li>
            <div>
              <img class="small--img" src="/img/graph.svg" alt="step4" />
              <p>
                In addition you have the opportunity to check the
                <b>strengths</b> and <b>weaknesses</b> of your CV on an
                interactive <b>graph</b>.
              </p>
            </div>
            <img class="howitworks__img" src="/img/how_graph.png" alt="Upload your CV" />
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="scan margin__bottom" id="scan">
    <div class="scan__container">
      <h2 class="subtitle--text">Scan your resume</h2>
      <form
        class="scan__form"
        action="/send-prompt"
        method="POST"
        enctype="multipart/form-data"
      >
        <div class="scan__formcontainer margin__bottom">
          <label class="scan__file" id="drop-zone" for="file-upload">
            <div class="preview" id="preview">
              <img
                src="/img/pdf-icon.svg"
                alt="Placeholder"
                id="decorative-image"
              />
              <p class="scan__placeholder">
                Drag and drop the PDF file here or select a file
              </p>
            </div>
            <input
              type="file"
              id="file-upload"
              name="file"
              accept="application/pdf"
              required
              hidden
            />
            <div class="file-name" id="file-name">File not selected</div>
            <label for="file-upload" class="upload-button">Upload</label>
          </label>
          <div class="normal--text scan__radios">
            <h3 class="blocktitle--text">Set company type</h3>
            <label
              ><input
                name="companyType"
                value="sturtup"
                type="radio"
                required
              />Startups</label
            >
            <label
              ><input
                name="companyType"
                value="bigtech"
                type="radio"
              />Bigtech</label
            >
            <label
              ><input
                name="companyType"
                value="outsource"
                type="radio"
              />Outsourcing</label
            >
            <label
              ><input name="companyType" value="product" type="radio" />Product
              Companies</label
            >
            <label
              ><input
                name="companyType"
                value="product"
                type="radio"
              />Fintech</label
            >
          </div>
          <div class="normal--text scan__radios">
            <h3 class="blocktitle--text">Set science level</h3>
            <label
              ><input
                name="scienceLevel"
                value="internship"
                type="radio"
                required
              />Internship</label
            >
            <label
              ><input
                name="scienceLevel"
                value="junior"
                type="radio"
              />Junior</label
            >
            <label
              ><input
                name="scienceLevel"
                value="middle"
                type="radio"
              />Middle</label
            >
            <label
              ><input
                name="scienceLevel"
                value="senior"
                type="radio"
              />Senior</label
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="scan__submit">
          <button class="button--general" type="submit">Analyze</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <div class="loader">
        <div>
          <div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="about blue__place margin__bottom" id="about">
    <div class="about__container">
      <h2 class="title--text">About Us</h2>
      <p class="normal--text">
        ResumeScanAi is a cutting-edge platform that leverages AI technology to
        help individuals validate and enhance their resumes. Our service is
        designed to offer tailored feedback based on the type of company and
        skill levels you're targeting, ensuring your resume meets industry
        standards. Whether you're an employer, HR specialist, or job seeker in
        IT or any other sector, our AI-enabled resume verification provides
        detailed insights to help you stand out. With ResumeScanAi, you can
        receive both general and specific recommendations that will elevate your
        resume to the next level.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="faq margin__bottom" id="faq">
    <div class="faq__container">
      <h2 class="subtitle--text">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <ul class="faq__list normal--text">
          <li class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__header">
              <h3 class="blocktitle--text">What is it for?</h3>
              <span class="faq__decor">
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="faq__answer">
              ResumeScanAI is primarily for convenience, there are a lot of tools like this out there, but all of them are large and complex systems. The genius is in the simplicity.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__header">
              <h3 class="blocktitle--text">How does it work under the bonnet?</h3>
              <span class="faq__decor">
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="faq__answer">
              Under the bonnet, a quality API is used to link your CV to an AI system that aims to both spot and globally analyse your CV.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__header">
              <h3 class="blocktitle--text">What is the target audience?</h3> 
              <span class="faq__decor">
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="faq__answer">
              First of all this tool is recognised for programmers, hr specialists and other IT specialists. But in the future we plan to extend ResumeScanAI for different fields of activity.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__header">
              <h3 class="blocktitle--text">How long is this tool relevant for?</h3>
              <span class="faq__decor">
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="faq__answer">
              This tool does not have a clear expiry date. The CV submission procedure is not new to anyone, and because of its convenience, it will remain in the hiring system for a long time to come.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="faq__item">
            <div class="faq__header">
              <h3 class="blocktitle--text">What's the global goal?</h3>
              <span class="faq__decor">
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="faq__answer">
              The global goal is to help people solve their problems. And one of the most annoying problems people have is the question - ‘How good is my CV for the job? What should I tweak to make my CV look better?’. That's the kind of question we help you answer.
            </p>
          </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="review margin__bottom" id="review">
    <div class="review__container">
      <h2 class="subtitle--text">Review</h2>
      <div class="review__content">
        <div>
          <div class="review__text">
            <img class="small--img" src="/img/heart.svg" alt="heart" />
            <p class="normal--text">
              Kind notes shared on Buy Me a Coffee will appear here.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footers/footer.ejs') %>
